1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,300
Every forest on Earth is gone.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,800
Except one.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,200
Sealed beneath a dome of glass,

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,800
the last tree still breathes.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,300
Its leaves glow with a light

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,800
no machine can copy.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,300
One scientist crosses the ash

8
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,800
carrying a single seed.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
She plants it in the dust,

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,800
and waits.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,200
The last tree on Earth was never the end.

12
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,800
It was the beginning.
